<title>USA: NGPL lifts 'critical time' on gas line.</title>
<headline>NGPL lifts 'critical time' on gas line.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Natural Gas Pipeline (NGPL) lifted its &quot;critical time&quot; and several operational flow orders (OFOs), effective for the gas day Sunday, Jan 12, the company said in a statement Monday.</p>
<p>The pipeline declared Friday a critical time for Saturday deliveries, limiting shippers to only nominated supplies.</p>
<p>NGPL, a unit of Occidental Petroleum, runs from western Texas to Illinois.</p>
<p>--((J Silha, New York Power Desk 212-859-1624))</p>
